			"color":"#232",
			"widgets_values":[
				"A cinematic oil painting shows a rainy night street in a modern Chinese city, viewed from a slightly low eye-level perspective. Wet asphalt reflects glowing neon signs in red, cyan, and amber, creating rippling pools of color across the street. On the right side stands a warmly lit tea restaurant with soft yellow window light spilling onto the pavement, while the left side of the scene is lined with dark storefronts, street lamps, and blurred silhouettes of a few pedestrians carrying umbrellas. In the middle distance, a tram slowly moves along the street, its windows glowing softly through the rain. The buildings rise upward into the misty night, with layers of soft light and atmospheric haze. The painting uses rich oil textures, visible brushstrokes, and slightly impressionistic handling of reflections, while still keeping the architecture and street perspective clear and believable. The palette combines deep indigo, charcoal, crimson, teal, wet silver-grey, and warm amber highlights. The rain, reflections, and glowing lights create a poetic, melancholic, and elegant mood, like a contemporary oil painting inspired by urban night life."
